      "html": "<article class=\"ds-boleto\"><div class=\"ds-boleto-cuerpo\"><p class=\"ds-boleto-dest\">Los Roques</p><p class=\"ds-boleto-det\">3 días, 2 noches. Vuelo y posada.</p></div><div class=\"ds-boleto-talon\"><p class=\"ds-boleto-cod\">LRQ-03</p><p class=\"ds-boleto-precio\">Desde $ 420</p><span class=\"ds-boleto-canto\"></span></div></article>",
